IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ha61-nouns`

-- Row il-61. THREE ITEMS, as typed values, each with its control. A date for which the sources held give no answer is not typed; there is no REFUSE. No day of effect is typed for any instrument: none is read.
-- LIMBS. Limb (a) asks whether the target is as the citing words say it is; limb (b) asks whether the citing words still read so in the latest official text. Each entry says where each limb was read from (see `Where a reading comes from` in ha61-nouns.l4).
-- The Hebrew Wikisource text is not official: every line of it is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY.

§ `Counting over a list`

GIVEN e IS A `A cited number in a list`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction deletes it from the list` MEANS
    IF e's `the consolidation prints it in the list` AND e's `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

GIVEN e IS A `A cited number in a list`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` MEANS
    IF e's `the consolidation prints it in the list` AND e's `an official instrument read by this row repeals the section it names`
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

GIVEN e IS A `A cited number in a list`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction adds it to the list` MEANS
    IF e's `the consolidation prints it in the list` AND e's `an official instruction read by this row adds it to the list`
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

`the number of entries of the list in s 4(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instruction deletes` MEANS
    `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction deletes it from the list` (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction deletes it from the list` (`list entry 5א in s 4(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction deletes it from the list` (`list entry 7ב עד 7ו in s 4(א)`)

`the number of entries of the list in s 4(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instruction adds` MEANS
    `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction adds it to the list` (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction adds it to the list` (`list entry 5א in s 4(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction adds it to the list` (`list entry 7ב עד 7ו in s 4(א)`)

`every entry the consolidation prints in the list in s 4(א) is one that no official instruction read by this row deletes` MEANS
    `the number of entries of the list in s 4(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instruction deletes` EQUALS 0

`the number of entries of the list in s 7(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instrument repeals the section of` MEANS
    `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` (`list entry 10 in s 7(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` (`list entry 9ג in s 7(א)`)
    + `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` (`list entry 29ה in s 7(א)`)

`every entry the consolidation prints in the list in s 7(א) names a section that no official instrument read by this row repeals` MEANS
    `the number of entries of the list in s 7(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instrument repeals the section of` EQUALS 0

