        `the list it is in` IS "s 4(א) of the Law"
        `the law the list cites` IS "Disabled Persons (Compensation and Rehabilitation) Law, 5719-1959"
        `the consolidation prints it in the list` IS TRUE
        `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list` IS TRUE
        `an official instruction read by this row adds it to the list` IS FALSE
        `an official instrument read by this row repeals the section it names` IS FALSE
        `an official instrument read by this row amends the section it names` IS FALSE
